# Derived build inputs, regenerated from the sealed snapshots by the WO-CRAFT-01
# scripts. Not tracked, for the same reason journal.jsonl and *_perfile.json are
# not: they are large, fully reproducible from inputs that ARE tracked, and
# committing them puts a 10.9 MB blob into permanent history on every rebuild.
#
# Reproduce with the reference implementation in docs/workorder-craft-01.md,
# which asserts every count exactly and fails loudly if a snapshot has moved.
#
# The snapshots they derive from are sealed and hash-verified, and the assertion
# counts are recorded in the work order, so the outputs are re-derivable and
# their correctness is checkable without storing them.
blueprint_index.json
item_descriptions.json
ingredient_index.json
blueprint_sources.json
